=2 Walkthrough
* Examine the Burning Circle ({z:Qu'Bia Arena}) for a cutscene, examine it again to begin the fight.
** Trusts can be called in this fight as of October 11, 2016.
* You will face 4 opponents in the BC:
** {m:Seed Yagudo}- WHM
*** Has a special ability called **Phantasmal Dance**, which causes AoE damage, Knockback, and {s:Bind}.
** {m:Seed Quadav}- RDM
*** Has a special ability called **Feather Maelstrom**, which causes Amnesia and {s:Bio}.
** {m:Seed Orc}- WAR, initally shares hate with the Yagudo, then the Quadav after the Yagudo is defeated.
*** Has a special ability called **Thunderous Yowl**, which gives AoE {p:Curse} and {p:Plague}.
** {m:Seed Goblin}- THF, likes to teleport behind random people and do weaponskills.
*** Has an ability called **Saucepan**, which gives all players in range a new food effect that gives -10 to all attributes.
**** This food effect seems to wear off in about 30 minutes.
*** Will randomly teleport around the arena during the fight.
*** Stacks {p:Sneak Attack} and {p:Trick Attack} when using both Goblin Rush and {s:Bomb Toss}.
* When the battle is completed, there will be a cutscene and you will receive {@k} {k:Ivory Key} (Level 70).

=2 "A Crystalline Prophecy" Key
* Re-obtain a {@k} {k:Mark of Seed} from the previous mission.
** Alternatively, {@k} {k:Mark of Seed} can be purchased from {n:Squintrox Dryeyes} for 1500g and 15 {i:Beastmen's Seals|Beastmen's Seal|1126} after all {p:Crystalline Missions|Category:Crystalline Missions} are completed.
* Repeat the mission to receive another {@k} {k:Ivory Key}.
* Use the {@k} {k:Ivory Key} (Level 70) to open the red treasure coffer at {z:Lower Jeuno} (J-8).
** Rewards are listed on the {p:Add-on Scenario Rewards} page.

